NumberField.Units.dirichletUnitTheorem.s.comment:
An infinite sequence of nonzero algebraic integers of `K` satisfying the following properties:
• `seq n` is nonzero;
• for `w : InfinitePlace K`, `w ≠ w₁ → w (seq n+1) < w (seq n)`;
• `∣norm (seq n)∣ ≤ B`.

